WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.334
Oh no!

2
00:00:01.654 --> 00:00:05.666
A mountain of fruit cards, and Maya has to sort every single one by hand!

3
00:00:05.986 --> 00:00:08.793
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:09.113 --> 00:00:11.140
This is Episode 87.

5
00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:13.202
Meet the learning robot.

6
00:00:13.522 --> 00:00:15.285
Maya shows it a lemon.

7
00:00:15.605 --> 00:00:16.983
Yellow bowl.

8
00:00:17.303 --> 00:00:18.529
A lime.

9
00:00:18.849 --> 00:00:20.176
Green bowl.

10
00:00:20.496 --> 00:00:22.168
The robot watches.

11
00:00:22.488 --> 00:00:23.907
It tries one.

12
00:00:24.227 --> 00:00:25.960
Oops, wrong bowl.

13
00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:28.955
Maya fixes it, and the robot remembers.

14
00:00:29.275 --> 00:00:30.622
Try again.

15
00:00:30.942 --> 00:00:32.087
Right!

16
00:00:32.407 --> 00:00:33.704
And again.

17
00:00:34.024 --> 00:00:35.169
Right!

18
00:00:35.489 --> 00:00:38.519
The more examples it sees, the smarter it gets.

19
00:00:38.839 --> 00:00:40.915
Now it sorts all by itself.

20
00:00:41.235 --> 00:00:42.755
A brand new card?

21
00:00:43.075 --> 00:00:45.406
It thinks, and still gets it right.

22
00:00:45.726 --> 00:00:47.793
That is Amazon SageMaker.

23
00:00:48.113 --> 00:00:52.024
You show it examples, it learns the pattern, and then it does the job for you.

24
00:00:52.344 --> 00:00:54.300
Now you know the learning robot!

25
00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

